      w2: { code: "SO3w4", route: "beruehmte-karl-lagerfeld", name: "Karl Lagerfeld", text: `the will to succeed becomes more style-conscious, tied to a sense of originality – success is also meant to look unmistakable, not just be measurable. Responds well to recognition for what's distinctive in her presentation, less well to interchangeable standard praise.` },
