      w2: { code: "SE7w8", route: "beruehmte-hans-zimmer", name: "Hans Zimmer", text: `enjoyment becomes more assertive, tied to a leaning toward intense, powerful execution – abundance is meant to come with visible impact too. Responds well to direct, energetic collaboration, less well to hesitant, indecisive approaches.` },
