      w2: { code: "SE8w9", route: "beruehmte-winston-churchill", name: "Winston Churchill", text: `strength becomes calmer, tied to a leaning toward long-term steadfastness – power shows up as quiet endurance rather than quick action. Responds well to reliable, patient collaboration, less well to hectic pressure.` },
