      w2: { code: "SX9w1", route: "beruehmte-keanu-reeves", name: "Keanu Reeves", text: `With a strongly expressed 1 wing, this dissolving softness combines with a quiet, almost ascetic restraint – devotion shows up not as dissolution, but as a calm, disciplined presence that claims little for itself.` },
